{"id":"639409","name":"可乐饼","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/639409/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火腿片","amount":"3片"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面包糠","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好所有食材。","img":"images/639409/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把土豆去皮切片。","img":"images/639409/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把洋葱和火腿片切成小丁。","img":"images/639409/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内加入适量食用油，放入洋葱翻炒。","img":"images/639409/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱炒软后加入火腿丁，继续翻炒一分钟。","img":"images/639409/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把土豆蒸熟。","img":"images/639409/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把土豆压成泥。","img":"images/639409/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入炒好的洋葱，火腿丁和适量黑胡椒粉，以及一小勺食盐。","img":"images/639409/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把它们拌均匀。","img":"images/639409/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捏成小圆球。","img":"images/639409/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"准备好油炸三件套。","img":"images/639409/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"土豆球裹上一层面粉。","img":"images/639409/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再裹上一层鸡蛋液。","img":"images/639409/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"最后裹上一层面包糠。","img":"images/639409/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"烤盘中铺上油纸放入土豆球。","img":"images/639409/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"烤箱提前预热到200°，摆入烤盘。","img":"images/639409/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"设置烤箱温度200度烤15分钟。","img":"images/639409/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"烤完出炉。","img":"images/639409/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"就是自己喜欢的酱料就可以开动啦。","img":"images/639409/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}